### 1. Crear y autorizar pago
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-001

{"merchantReference":"order-1001","amount":150.50,"currency":"PEN"}

### 2. Consultar diagnósticos de weaving
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/aop/diagnostics

### 3. Pago que fuerza dos fallas transitorias y demuestra retry
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: retry-001

{"merchantReference":"order-retry","amount":13.37,"currency":"PEN"}
